\f4  
\f0 \uc0\u55349 \u56338 \u55349 \u56365 \u55349 \u56350 \u55349 \u56361 
\f4 .
\f9\b0  Kuvaa ohjelmiston sykliaikaa. Mit\'e4 pienempi 
\f0\b \uc0\u55349 \u56349 \u55349 \u56365 
\f9\b0 , sit\'e4 useammin 
\f0\b \uc0\u55349 \u57023 
\f1\b0 \uc0\u8347 \u8336 
\f2\b \uc0\u1378 
\f3 \uc0\u8337 
\f9\b0  p\'e4ivittyy, mik\'e4 mahdollistaa \'e4\'e4rimm\'e4isen tarkan kontrollin.\
